  "notes": [
    "Before the runtime starts the worker completes phase B (collect_host_blocks -> finalize -> upload prompt -> context.finalize_manifest), then separately sends renew_lease with stage_record_id, step_id and phase=runtime_started. Refusal or cancel_requested prevents spawn; handoff refusal returns next and has already closed the draft reservation.",
    "A repeated begin_stage with the same (stage_id, round_no, input_digest) returns the same stage_record_id; for a completed stage already_completed = true and prior_outcome is filled.",
    "Expected admission/budget refusal is a successful HTTP/bus result with outcome=refused and next: StageInstruction. Its failed stage, closed reservations and advance effects commit atomically; the worker follows next and never starts a runtime or submits RecordStageResult for the refusal."
